ind":"announcement","title":"Scared Crow Launches November 5! Play the Free Demo During Steam Next Fest","summary":"Hello, deckbuilders!Scared Crow is taking part in Steam Next Fest! Download the free demo, take a seat at the table, and put your build to the test.We’re also excited to announce that Scared Crow launches on November 5 for US$8.99, with 10% off during launch week!It’s been over nine months since we released the Scared Crow demo on January 12, 2026. Since then, we’ve released multiple updates, reworking the UI, adjusting card and ability balance, and refining the tutorial. Our goal has been to ma","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T03:01:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706693514","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4135930-1841579228670772","game_id":"steam-4135930","kind":"announcement","title":"Scared Crow Teams Up with Flawless Gaming!","summary":"Hello everyone!We’ve got some huge news to share today: the strategy card rogue-lite game Scared Crow is officially joining the Flawless Gaming publishing family! We are also incredibly honored to participate in the Steam China Showcase 2026!🎮 Demo & Survey InfoThe free playable Demo is available now! You can access the feedback survey directly from the main menu in-game (or here). We can't wait to hear your honest feedback!Demo Content: Features 3 main bosses, with an estimated play time of aro","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-22T05:11:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228670772","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4135930-1822556746164877","game_id":"steam-4135930","kind":"update","title":"1.25 demo daily update","summary":"Fix the shortcut-related bugs and add a new shortcut to open the discard pile.Make the range indicator a toggleable feature and fix bugs where it is misaligned or does not disappear in time.Add a toggleable feature to display stickers in battles, and fix bugs where they do not disappear at the end of battles, as well as virus-related issues.Introduce the new blue card \"Moss\" (thanks to the inspiration from netizen \"心火焚花\").Reduce the rarity of the Ice Block and Fire Extinguisher cards.Add a sleep","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-01-25T06:08:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1822556746164877","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4135930-1822556746156105","game_id":"steam-4135930","kind":"update","title":"1.21 demo daily update","summary":"The same enemy will not be encountered within the same floor.Optimize the size of description text to prevent overlapping elements.Revise the reward method for stickers—now distributed in sticker packs instead of multiple duplicate stickers.The stickers from Thorny Operations now have a fixed rarity.The growth target of the Pure Seed is changed to the first card in the backpack.Fixed interaction bugs with lasers, corrected the issue where mirrors did not strictly copy energy, and resolved the bu","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-01-21T07:46:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1822556746156105","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4135930-1821922921820967","game_id":"steam-4135930","kind":"update","title":"1.19 demo daily update","summary":"UFO can now draw a card each time it enters the battlefield.Fixed various bugs caused by removing the Joker.Fixed the bug where the Piggy Bank's money could be stolen.Further optimized some UI elements and the timing of card description display during battles.Virus, Carbon, and other similar cards now benefit from target attribute bonuses.Added a UI indicator for area-of-effect range.Updated cards on the bench.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-01-19T12:11:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1821922921820967","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4135930-1821922921817698","game_id":"steam-4135930","kind":"update","title":"1.17 demo daily update","summary":"Adjust the position of action prompts to prevent them from appearing off-screen.Replace the initial boss with a more friendly grandfather clock.Modify some of the art and UI elements.The leaderboard is now hidden by default to prevent new players from immediately competing against experienced ones.Add additional background music tracks.Add subtle animations to the action buttons.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-01-17T09:00:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1821922921817698","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4135930-1821922921815291","game_id":"steam-4135930","kind":"update","title":"1.16 demo daily update","summary":"Fixed a texture bug caused by discarding seeds with the shieldFixed the audio bug for the Copper Treasure Chest and a bug where the treasure chest event duration could be extended via Save/Load.Adjusted the effect of Maple Leaves—they now benefit from target attribute bonuses.Fixed a bug where tooltip descriptions sometimes did not disappear in a timely manner.Fixed an issue where cards like the Anchor could exceed the energy limit, and capped the maximum number of elements in the healing animat","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-01-16T08:33:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1821922921815291","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4135930-1821922921810037","game_id":"steam-4135930","kind":"update","title":"1.14 Demo daily update","summary":"Added Discord invite link.Improved music looping functionality.Turn-end effects now trigger in positional order.The scarecrow now only has a one-third chance of displaying an emote upon victory.Fixed the calculation method for the \"All Is Void\" action.Adjusted card decks for multiple scarecrows including Blacksmith Bear, Great Goose, etc.Fixed seed-related bugs.Added the ability to retry a battle after defeat.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-01-14T09:07:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1821922921810037","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4135930-1821288646587798","game_id":"steam-4135930","kind":"update","title":"Demo 1.13 daily update","summary":"Fixed the bug preventing the \"Reakless\" achievement from triggering.Reduced the time cost for \"Initiative\" and \"Stopwatch\" by one day.Adjusted the effect of \"Cake\" to grant a trait; its time cost increased to four days.Fixed the bug causing \"Croissant\" to be ineffective.Increased the default volume for music and sound effects.Updated the \"Bench\" card.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-01-13T11:13:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1821288646587798","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:19Z","discovery_method":"of